What's new in 0.1.8

• A new look: warm paper and ink, and one accent colour instead of gradients. Easier to read at a glance.
• Home now shows what needs you — a budget that is over, or messages waiting to be sorted — instead of a chart.
• Insiders: activity rows show the time, Insights ranks your top categories and merchants, and Plan says how far over you are and on what.
• The first-run screens match the new look.
